(1154201, 144222, 28108, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. I think if this would be for an advertisement photograph, the client might not be happy with having it''s name blured, even lightly... But I like it. The lighting is very good exept a little washed-out on the rim of the cup.</td>', 'Nicely done. I think if this would be for an advertisement photograph, the client might not be happy with having it''s name blured, even lightly... But I like it. The lighting is very good exept a little washed-out on the rim of the cup.', '2005-02-07 01:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
