(1154214, 144159, 28108, '<td valign="top">It would have been more interesting to see less of them and better croped. Zoom-in or get closer and shoot two placed in each verticle third. The composition would be largely improved. Often, just applying the rule of third turns a snapshot in a nice candid photograph. Also the focus is a little too soft.</td>', 'It would have been more interesting to see less of them and better croped. Zoom-in or get closer and shoot two placed in each verticle third. The composition would be largely improved. Often, just applying the rule of third turns a snapshot in a nice candid photograph. Also the focus is a little too soft.', '2005-02-07 01:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
