(1154341, 144009, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is extremely loveable, and lovingly rendered. The angle is a littlke awkward for me, which keeps it a notch below 10. I''d have cloned out the bumper mount and the bit of floor lower left, this would have helped quite a bit for me.</td>', 'This is extremely loveable, and lovingly rendered. The angle is a littlke awkward for me, which keeps it a notch below 10. I''d have cloned out the bumper mount and the bit of floor lower left, this would have helped quite a bit for me.', '2005-02-07 02:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
