(1154346, 144467, 30861, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous, and different. Stunningly sharp, also.  This challenge made me want to barf, allt he flowers, I''m scoring up the images that tried something different. I really appreciate this shot, the lighting of it, the little bit of eye that''s visible, so much to like.</td>', 'Gorgeous, and different. Stunningly sharp, also.  This challenge made me want to barf, allt he flowers, I''m scoring up the images that tried something different. I really appreciate this shot, the lighting of it, the little bit of eye that''s visible, so much to like.', '2005-02-07 02:45:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1154347, 144367, 28108, '<td valign="top">Eventough I''m not the author of this photograph, I think it should be dedicated to Jacko''s baby-girl, Stéphanie.</td>', 'Eventough I''m not the author of this photograph, I think it should be dedicated to Jacko''s baby-girl, Stéphanie.', '2005-02-07 02:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1154348, 143954, 30861, '<td valign="top">It''s funny how this feels a little ccw rotated (just a tad) even though a reasonably close examination suggests it''s not. Certainly the horizontal courses at the top are level, and the left edge of the door is vertical...  I digress... I liek this very much, and hope it fares better with the voters than i expect it will. I scored it very high, and really appreciate it daring to be different. The tonal quality of the chrome, btw, is superb. Heck, the whole image is nailed as far as tonal range goes. Nice work.</td>', 'It''s funny how this feels a little ccw rotated (just a tad) even though a reasonably close examination suggests it''s not. Certainly the horizontal courses at the top are level, and the left edge of the door is vertical...  I digress... I liek this very much, and hope it fares better with the voters than i expect it will. I scored it very high, and really appreciate it daring to be different. The tonal quality of the chrome, btw, is superb. Heck, the whole image is nailed as far as tonal range goes. Nice work.', '2005-02-07 02:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1154349, 144301, 30861, '<td valign="top">A very nice image marred somewhat by esxtremely static composition.</td>', 'A very nice image marred somewhat by esxtremely static composition.', '2005-02-07 02:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1154352, 144239, 30861, '<td valign="top">Conceptually I adore this. The execution, however, is lackluster. Literally. There''s no sense of glow at all, and I really need some luminosity in the image. I gave it a good score, for bravery if nothign else. Good luck.</td>', 'Conceptually I adore this. The execution, however, is lackluster. Literally. There''s no sense of glow at all, and I really need some luminosity in the image. I gave it a good score, for bravery if nothign else. Good luck.', '2005-02-07 02:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
