(1154462, 143754, 18552, '<td valign="top">Lovely, the flower looks just beautiful and the blurred glass is just right, too. My eyes keep wanting to see the rest of the flower, I''d love to see a version that has a whole flower in it. The pink color is so restful and peaceful.</td>', 'Lovely, the flower looks just beautiful and the blurred glass is just right, too. My eyes keep wanting to see the rest of the flower, I''d love to see a version that has a whole flower in it. The pink color is so restful and peaceful.', '2005-02-07 05:39:14.000000', NULL, 1),
