(1154473, 144436, 18552, '<td valign="top">Usually, I don''t care very much for nude studies but your picture is really nice. I like the sense of innocence that shows through. The soft focus is nice and the creamy white rather than stark white.</td>', 'Usually, I don''t care very much for nude studies but your picture is really nice. I like the sense of innocence that shows through. The soft focus is nice and the creamy white rather than stark white.', '2005-02-07 05:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
