(1154485, 143553, 18552, '<td valign="top">Very cute and sweet. Love the pink shades. Her skin is so smooth - it looks like you might have used a lot of neat image; however, perhaps being a baby she really has such beautiful skin. The expression on her face is just priceless!</td>', 'Very cute and sweet. Love the pink shades. Her skin is so smooth - it looks like you might have used a lot of neat image; however, perhaps being a baby she really has such beautiful skin. The expression on her face is just priceless!', '2005-02-07 05:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
