(1154493, 143760, 23478, '<td valign="top">This could have been cropped a bit tighter on the flowers and just slightly sharped to make for an image with higher impact.</td>', 'This could have been cropped a bit tighter on the flowers and just slightly sharped to make for an image with higher impact.', '2005-02-07 05:59:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1154495, 142986, 18552, '<td valign="top">Very pretty girl and nice clear picture. However, her skin looks like it''s made of pastic or something. Perhaps you used too much Neat Image. The hand is so smooth that it looks really unnatural.</td>', 'Very pretty girl and nice clear picture. However, her skin looks like it''s made of pastic or something. Perhaps you used too much Neat Image. The hand is so smooth that it looks really unnatural.', '2005-02-07 06:02:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1154496, 144337, 18552, '<td valign="top">Great idea and well executed, too. I love how you can see the chalky powdery look of the candy hearts and the contrast of the one white heart. Perhaps if the DOF would have been just a bit deeper it would have been nicer - the one blurry heart on the bottom just left of center kind of throws the balance of the picture off a bit. 7</td>', 'Great idea and well executed, too. I love how you can see the chalky powdery look of the candy hearts and the contrast of the one white heart. Perhaps if the DOF would have been just a bit deeper it would have been nicer - the one blurry heart on the bottom just left of center kind of throws the balance of the picture off a bit. 7', '2005-02-07 06:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
