(1154508, 144257, 18552, '<td valign="top">The pink scarf is cool and a very bright and nice shade of pink. The black bra really seems to overcome the effect of the pink and the bra becomes more the main subject of the picture rather than the pink scarf. Perhaps a beige bra or nude would have really made that pink scarf stand out more.</td>', 'The pink scarf is cool and a very bright and nice shade of pink. The black bra really seems to overcome the effect of the pink and the bra becomes more the main subject of the picture rather than the pink scarf. Perhaps a beige bra or nude would have really made that pink scarf stand out more.', '2005-02-07 06:13:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1154512, 144242, 32602, '<td valign="top">Very pretty portrait. I like the way  the ropes are the only thing visible in the background. The upper strands of hair that cross the face are a bit distracting. Lovely.</td>', 'Very pretty portrait. I like the way  the ropes are the only thing visible in the background. The upper strands of hair that cross the face are a bit distracting. Lovely.', '2005-02-07 06:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
