(1154643, 143994, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is quite nice but I think it would have worked better without the stars. I understand they are meant to represent ''starry-eyed optimism'' but the star at the left of the frame obscures the sillhouetted couple. I don''t usuallly enjoy selective desaturation but here it works well. The shades looming so largely in the foreground give the image the feel of a surrealistic painting. The soft, grainy appearance of the sky enhances the theme quite nicely. <br/></td>', 'This is quite nice but I think it would have worked better without the stars. I understand they are meant to represent ''starry-eyed optimism'' but the star at the left of the frame obscures the sillhouetted couple. I don''t usuallly enjoy selective desaturation but here it works well. The shades looming so largely in the foreground give the image the feel of a surrealistic painting. The soft, grainy appearance of the sky enhances the theme quite nicely. ', '2005-02-07 08:24:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1154647, 144366, 7322, '<td valign="top">Simple and powerfully graphic. The texture of the ball combined with the lighting gives this a rather lunar appearance that exaggerates the significance of the ball and makes an almost humorous statement. I''m not sure if that was the intention but it works for me.</td>', 'Simple and powerfully graphic. The texture of the ball combined with the lighting gives this a rather lunar appearance that exaggerates the significance of the ball and makes an almost humorous statement. I''m not sure if that was the intention but it works for me.', '2005-02-07 08:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1154649, 144434, 7322, '<td valign="top">This would have worked better for me if the panties were the only fabric we could see. The flannel poodle pajamas don''t add anything. Also, the goose pimples on her thighs aren''t too appealing. Perhaps this could have been smooth out using your imaging softwear? I like the quality of the light and the shadows it creates.</td>', 'This would have worked better for me if the panties were the only fabric we could see. The flannel poodle pajamas don''t add anything. Also, the goose pimples on her thighs aren''t too appealing. Perhaps this could have been smooth out using your imaging softwear? I like the quality of the light and the shadows it creates.', '2005-02-07 08:29:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1154650, 142865, 18484, '<td valign="top">Great shot!!</td>', 'Great shot!!', '2005-02-07 08:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1154652, 144022, 7322, '<td valign="top">Cute model. I like her expression of comical dejection.The colors in the feathers and beads are a teensy bit washed out looking but her skin looks lovely so I think that''s just nitpicking.</td>', 'Cute model. I like her expression of comical dejection.The colors in the feathers and beads are a teensy bit washed out looking but her skin looks lovely so I think that''s just nitpicking.', '2005-02-07 08:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1154656, 144515, 7322, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting and exposure. One suggestion is to tone down the bright highlights with the clone tool.  Some highlights are needed to show texture but the ones in the paint near the rim of the jar detract. <br/>I think the cropping is a teensy bit too close at the top of the frame. The interruption to the circle the cropping creates is visually jarring to me (sorry, pun not intended).</td>', 'Very nice lighting and exposure. One suggestion is to tone down the bright highlights with the clone tool.  Some highlights are needed to show texture but the ones in the paint near the rim of the jar detract. I think the cropping is a teensy bit too close at the top of the frame. The interruption to the circle the cropping creates is visually jarring to me (sorry, pun not intended).', '2005-02-07 08:37:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1154657, 144489, 7322, '<td valign="top">A nice approach. I don''t really care for the view of the dead grass. It interrupts the nice graphic quality of the image without adding anything.</td>', 'A nice approach. I don''t really care for the view of the dead grass. It interrupts the nice graphic quality of the image without adding anything.', '2005-02-07 08:38:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1154663, 144261, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a nice close-up in terms of composition but it has a lifeless appearance. I believe this is a combination of flat lighting and fake flowers. The petals lack the luminous quality of the real thing.</td>', 'This is a nice close-up in terms of composition but it has a lifeless appearance. I believe this is a combination of flat lighting and fake flowers. The petals lack the luminous quality of the real thing.', '2005-02-07 08:42:01.000000', NULL, 1),
