(1154715, 143845, 7322, '<td valign="top">Better rethink your title. There is nothing soft-looking about this artificial flower. I would suggest next time just going to the grocery store and spending a couple of bucks on the real thing to photograph. You obviously went to some effort to light it sinec the lighting looks good. It''s wasted on the subject matter.</td>', 'Better rethink your title. There is nothing soft-looking about this artificial flower. I would suggest next time just going to the grocery store and spending a couple of bucks on the real thing to photograph. You obviously went to some effort to light it sinec the lighting looks good. It''s wasted on the subject matter.', '2005-02-07 09:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1154727, 144102, 31403, '<td valign="top">cool prop, I would love to see a more "cropped" exploration of it.  this feels like it was just tossed on the grass and a snapshot.  the blown highlights in the mask give me that sense of "snapshotness''.</td>', 'cool prop, I would love to see a more "cropped" exploration of it.  this feels like it was just tossed on the grass and a snapshot.  the blown highlights in the mask give me that sense of "snapshotness''.', '2005-02-07 09:53:48.000000', NULL, 1),
