(1155145, 144093, 31865, '<td valign="top">this is definitely different.  I like the composition and the creativity.  It''s a little pixelated on the closest pig but cool photo nonetheless.</td>', 'this is definitely different.  I like the composition and the creativity.  It''s a little pixelated on the closest pig but cool photo nonetheless.', '2005-02-07 14:17:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1155148, 144219, 31865, '<td valign="top">He''s such a cutie.  I love the detail in his eyes.  The lip prints almost dont look real because they''re so smooth. This doesn''t take away from the photo at all though.  Great idea and wonderfully done.</td>', 'He''s such a cutie.  I love the detail in his eyes.  The lip prints almost dont look real because they''re so smooth. This doesn''t take away from the photo at all though.  Great idea and wonderfully done.', '2005-02-07 14:19:11.000000', NULL, 1),
