(1155151, 144479, 26756, '<td valign="top">While the pink is of course the center of attention and what makes it fit the challenge, it''s the deep green leaves and their texture that makes this photo stand out.</td>', 'While the pink is of course the center of attention and what makes it fit the challenge, it''s the deep green leaves and their texture that makes this photo stand out.', '2005-02-07 14:21:11.000000', NULL, 1),
