(1155190, 143872, 31172, '<td valign="top">Cool picture, neat sky, Infrared???  It''s Apocalypse by the way.</td>', 'Cool picture, neat sky, Infrared???  It''s Apocalypse by the way.', '2005-02-07 14:36:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1155193, 144242, 31865, '<td valign="top">I love the shot but it looks like a smart blur filter was used, which almost makes it look like a painting instead of a photo.  I would have liked it better without the filter I think.</td>', 'I love the shot but it looks like a smart blur filter was used, which almost makes it look like a painting instead of a photo.  I would have liked it better without the filter I think.', '2005-02-07 14:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
