(1155196, 144256, 31865, '<td valign="top">nice shot.  Reminds me of the eighties for some reason.  Would be a good ad for slinky pink.</td>', 'nice shot.  Reminds me of the eighties for some reason.  Would be a good ad for slinky pink.', '2005-02-07 14:40:02.000000', NULL, 1),
