(1155203, 144417, 3569, '<td valign="top">Interesting, but not sure if it works well with the lace/wicker</td>', 'Interesting, but not sure if it works well with the lace/wicker', '2005-02-07 14:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1155204, 144237, 31865, '<td valign="top">The image seems kind of flat to me.  I think it might have worked better on a white background to bring out some of the luminescence of the candy.  Maybe at a different angle with a smaller depth of field.</td>', 'The image seems kind of flat to me.  I think it might have worked better on a white background to bring out some of the luminescence of the candy.  Maybe at a different angle with a smaller depth of field.', '2005-02-07 14:46:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1155205, 144490, 31865, '<td valign="top">this one totally cracks me up.  And I love the title.  I''ve never seen a flower shot with such human characteristics.  Great idea!</td>', 'this one totally cracks me up.  And I love the title.  I''ve never seen a flower shot with such human characteristics.  Great idea!', '2005-02-07 14:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1155207, 144291, 31865, '<td valign="top">Well, the hat is definitely pink, but other than that, the photo doesn''t make much sense to me.  It seems very unplanned.  Candids are fine but I think they should have a purpose.  It seems a little busy as well.  I''m not really sure what I''m looking at.  The hat could have been a great subject, if used in a better way, i think.</td>', 'Well, the hat is definitely pink, but other than that, the photo doesn''t make much sense to me.  It seems very unplanned.  Candids are fine but I think they should have a purpose.  It seems a little busy as well.  I''m not really sure what I''m looking at.  The hat could have been a great subject, if used in a better way, i think.', '2005-02-07 14:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1155208, 144407, 26045, '<td valign="top">This just is not composed well. The backdrop, the pose, the lighting, the harsh tones, all of these things lead me to score the photo low. The shot might''ve been better had the DRINK been the focal point ahaha. Sorry!</td>', 'This just is not composed well. The backdrop, the pose, the lighting, the harsh tones, all of these things lead me to score the photo low. The shot might''ve been better had the DRINK been the focal point ahaha. Sorry!', '2005-02-07 14:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1155210, 143994, 31865, '<td valign="top">I''m liking this.  It''s a little grainy, but the concept makes up for that.  Neat shot.</td>', 'I''m liking this.  It''s a little grainy, but the concept makes up for that.  Neat shot.', '2005-02-07 14:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1155212, 144265, 26045, '<td valign="top">hahaha if you say so!</td>', 'hahaha if you say so!', '2005-02-07 14:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1155213, 144516, 31865, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot.</td>', 'beautiful shot.', '2005-02-07 14:52:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1155216, 143461, 26045, '<td valign="top">awwwwww! I''ll give you a pity point ;)<br/> <br/>Nah, seriously though: the back hearts are well lit while the front broken heart is dark as dark can be. The shot would be way better if the broken heart was more illuminated and close up, with the "so happy together" hearts were darker, more in the background. <br/> <br/>But aside from all that, I really like this! Good luck!</td>', 'awwwwww! I''ll give you a pity point ;) Nah, seriously though: the back hearts are well lit while the front broken heart is dark as dark can be. The shot would be way better if the broken heart was more illuminated and close up, with the "so happy together" hearts were darker, more in the background.  But aside from all that, I really like this! Good luck!', '2005-02-07 14:53:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1155219, 144250, 26045, '<td valign="top">Solemnity and hot pink eyeshadow just don''t seem to go together! I would''ve rated this higher had the eyeshadow been nixed, as the soft tones and her facial expression are rather endearing. But those eyes...they really just throw the whole thing off for me. I still like it though! Good luck!</td>', 'Solemnity and hot pink eyeshadow just don''t seem to go together! I would''ve rated this higher had the eyeshadow been nixed, as the soft tones and her facial expression are rather endearing. But those eyes...they really just throw the whole thing off for me. I still like it though! Good luck!', '2005-02-07 14:54:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1155223, 144452, 26045, '<td valign="top">Excellent, just excellent. 10</td>', 'Excellent, just excellent. 10', '2005-02-07 14:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1155224, 144521, 26045, '<td valign="top">Oh, brother...do you really think this is a good shot? It''s all out of focus, and what''s out of focus is two slabs of gross looking meat. Sorry to be so negative, but oy vey, I see no upside.</td>', 'Oh, brother...do you really think this is a good shot? It''s all out of focus, and what''s out of focus is two slabs of gross looking meat. Sorry to be so negative, but oy vey, I see no upside.', '2005-02-07 14:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1155226, 144232, 26045, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, crisp. Love it!</td>', 'Beautiful, crisp. Love it!', '2005-02-07 14:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1155227, 143476, 26045, '<td valign="top">That funny little pink thingie really ruins the shot for me! If it was just the glass with the goopy pink stuff, I think it would fare much better with me. It''s just such a cool looking glass ahaha. And also, it''s really harsh light on the left side of the glass. But other than that, I dig. Good luck!</td>', 'That funny little pink thingie really ruins the shot for me! If it was just the glass with the goopy pink stuff, I think it would fare much better with me. It''s just such a cool looking glass ahaha. And also, it''s really harsh light on the left side of the glass. But other than that, I dig. Good luck!', '2005-02-07 14:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1155229, 143995, 30712, '<td valign="top">Getting close in like this gives the image much more impact than when the whole bird is visible.  A classy image.</td>', 'Getting close in like this gives the image much more impact than when the whole bird is visible.  A classy image.', '2005-02-07 15:01:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1155230, 144167, 26045, '<td valign="top">Stellar outfit! Great lighting! She looks a tad uncomfortable from the waist down - her hand and her feet. Caught off guard almost. But it''s such a cool mod shot, I''m still gonna vote it high :)</td>', 'Stellar outfit! Great lighting! She looks a tad uncomfortable from the waist down - her hand and her feet. Caught off guard almost. But it''s such a cool mod shot, I''m still gonna vote it high :)', '2005-02-07 15:01:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1155231, 144051, 2022, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge (4), technically good (2), good composition (2), wow factor (0). That works out to 8.</td>', 'Meets the challenge (4), technically good (2), good composition (2), wow factor (0). That works out to 8.', '2005-02-07 15:01:58.000000', NULL, 1),
