(1155237, 143538, 26045, '<td valign="top">Yaknow, I would''ve given this a 10 in the light challenge :)<br/> <br/>But for pink...okay, there''s a slight pink tone to the wall...I''ll vote ya middleground.</td>', 'Yaknow, I would''ve given this a 10 in the light challenge :) But for pink...okay, there''s a slight pink tone to the wall...I''ll vote ya middleground.', '2005-02-07 15:03:45.000000', NULL, 1),
