(1155241, 143976, 26045, '<td valign="top">Very, very, very cool. The bottle is barely noticeable until ya really take a look, but it''s such a cool shot I kept staring ahaha. Now, my only qualm is with those toenails! Either way, it''s a 10 from me!</td>', 'Very, very, very cool. The bottle is barely noticeable until ya really take a look, but it''s such a cool shot I kept staring ahaha. Now, my only qualm is with those toenails! Either way, it''s a 10 from me!', '2005-02-07 15:05:43.000000', NULL, 1),
