(1155639, 143887, 26756, '<td valign="top">Yowza.  An interesting look coming from a child.  A bit freaky.  Good focus, different and interesting subject.  Not too hot about the brick background though.  It''s not too complimentary and would have been much better left completely out of focus to give just a soft yellow background.</td>', 'Yowza.  An interesting look coming from a child.  A bit freaky.  Good focus, different and interesting subject.  Not too hot about the brick background though.  It''s not too complimentary and would have been much better left completely out of focus to give just a soft yellow background.', '2005-02-07 18:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1155640, 144242, 24065, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful photograph -- the lighting, colors and composition appear very good.  However, it is obvious that NeatImage or something similar was way overused on some parts while leaving too much noise in others -- mainly shadowed areas.  I''m wondering if your ISO might have been too high or if it was just the settings on the NeatImage.  After the challenge is over you might want to post this one and your original in a forum thread and get some feedback.  I suspect your score will be rather low, but don''t know how many will stop to tell you that it''s because of the post-processing, not the subject.  I do hope this is helpful information :)</td>', 'This is a beautiful photograph -- the lighting, colors and composition appear very good.  However, it is obvious that NeatImage or something similar was way overused on some parts while leaving too much noise in others -- mainly shadowed areas.  I''m wondering if your ISO might have been too high or if it was just the settings on the NeatImage.  After the challenge is over you might want to post this one and your original in a forum thread and get some feedback.  I suspect your score will be rather low, but don''t know how many will stop to tell you that it''s because of the post-processing, not the subject.  I do hope this is helpful information :)', '2005-02-07 18:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
