(1155684, 142707, 18367, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love the lighting in the photo and the contrast provided by the background.  The photo is perfect in every regard, but for the fact that pink does not seem to be the prevailing colour.  It is with regret that I must inform you that I only gave this a 9.  Great shot and the best of luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I absolutely love the lighting in the photo and the contrast provided by the background.  The photo is perfect in every regard, but for the fact that pink does not seem to be the prevailing colour.  It is with regret that I must inform you that I only gave this a 9.  Great shot and the best of luck in the challenge.', '2005-02-07 18:34:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1155686, 143538, 208, '<td valign="top">Very cool. Nice subtle use of pink. I''d like the shadow across her face a bit higher to better cover her eyes and that annoying dot of nose. I like how the shadow looks so different than her pose.</td>', 'Very cool. Nice subtle use of pink. I''d like the shadow across her face a bit higher to better cover her eyes and that annoying dot of nose. I like how the shadow looks so different than her pose.', '2005-02-07 18:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1155696, 143748, 18367, '<td valign="top">Very cleverly executed.  I have been admiring this for a bit and love the way you took something as simple as crayons and managed to add a whole new dimension to it.  Great job and keep up the good work.</td>', 'Very cleverly executed.  I have been admiring this for a bit and love the way you took something as simple as crayons and managed to add a whole new dimension to it.  Great job and keep up the good work.', '2005-02-07 18:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1155700, 144239, 16790, '<td valign="top">Very pretty - I like the soft feel of this photo.  My only criticisms would be that it lacks drama - filling the whole frame with the flower just doesn''t have the same appeal as if there was a bit of negative space - and that the surface the flower is sitting on is a tad distracting.</td>', 'Very pretty - I like the soft feel of this photo.  My only criticisms would be that it lacks drama - filling the whole frame with the flower just doesn''t have the same appeal as if there was a bit of negative space - and that the surface the flower is sitting on is a tad distracting.', '2005-02-07 18:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1155702, 144169, 16790, '<td valign="top">Aaee!  Scary.  Focus on this is excellent, though, and I like the lighting though it is a tad harsh in spots... it seems to work for the super-close photo.  Still scary though.  Good job nonetheless :)</td>', 'Aaee!  Scary.  Focus on this is excellent, though, and I like the lighting though it is a tad harsh in spots... it seems to work for the super-close photo.  Still scary though.  Good job nonetheless :)', '2005-02-07 18:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
