(1155809, 143559, 20941, '<td valign="top">nice composition and good subject tho the well captured droplets may be too numerous, kinda obscuring focus on the pink buds.</td>', 'nice composition and good subject tho the well captured droplets may be too numerous, kinda obscuring focus on the pink buds.', '2005-02-07 19:45:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1155812, 144407, 259, '<td valign="top">while you did meet the challenge, there are some areas which could use some improvement.  i like your choice of white for the background.  however, the wrinkles and creases in the sheet are distracting.  one good way to minimize the appearance of wrinkles would be to have your model sit further away from the sheet.  so the background would loose some focus.  also, she appears to be sitting just slightly off center.  sitting totally off center or dead center would make a stronger composition.  and one last small thing is, one foot is slightly cropped.  since everything else is totally in the frame the whole foot should be as well.</td>', 'while you did meet the challenge, there are some areas which could use some improvement.  i like your choice of white for the background.  however, the wrinkles and creases in the sheet are distracting.  one good way to minimize the appearance of wrinkles would be to have your model sit further away from the sheet.  so the background would loose some focus.  also, she appears to be sitting just slightly off center.  sitting totally off center or dead center would make a stronger composition.  and one last small thing is, one foot is slightly cropped.  since everything else is totally in the frame the whole foot should be as well.', '2005-02-07 19:47:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1155823, 143469, 259, '<td valign="top">i really like how you''ve filled the frame with your subject.  the pink really jumps out easily.  the only downside i see is that the highlight on the nose competes for attention with the pink straps.  the whole top of the picture is dark but the nose, which really draws my attention to it.</td>', 'i really like how you''ve filled the frame with your subject.  the pink really jumps out easily.  the only downside i see is that the highlight on the nose competes for attention with the pink straps.  the whole top of the picture is dark but the nose, which really draws my attention to it.', '2005-02-07 19:51:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1155827, 142669, 259, '<td valign="top">great looking composition.</td>', 'great looking composition.', '2005-02-07 19:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1155831, 143976, 259, '<td valign="top">excellent.  easily a top shot for sure.  the high key look works really well.</td>', 'excellent.  easily a top shot for sure.  the high key look works really well.', '2005-02-07 19:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
