(1156089, 143997, 14986, '<td valign="top">Even if I call the shade pink, which in my opinion it is not, it still is not the primary focus of the shot.  There just isn''t enough of an interesting subject here  to hold my attention.</td>', 'Even if I call the shade pink, which in my opinion it is not, it still is not the primary focus of the shot.  There just isn''t enough of an interesting subject here  to hold my attention.', '2005-02-07 21:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1156092, 142317, 18194, '<td valign="top">The highlights in the pink seem a little blown out to me. I am not sure this is the best angle to photograph from, maybe a bit lower?</td>', 'The highlights in the pink seem a little blown out to me. I am not sure this is the best angle to photograph from, maybe a bit lower?', '2005-02-07 21:51:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1156095, 143094, 25232, '<td valign="top">You are still a little bright in the whites of the eyes. I gave you a 10 on the last one but this will only get you an 8 because of the un-natural contrast in the eyes. I love your work. Don''t over work it. <br/> <br/>By the way I will hopefully be passing through Bangkok next year on my way to Cambodia and would feel honored if I could buy you a beer while I was in town.</td>', 'You are still a little bright in the whites of the eyes. I gave you a 10 on the last one but this will only get you an 8 because of the un-natural contrast in the eyes. I love your work. Don''t over work it.  By the way I will hopefully be passing through Bangkok next year on my way to Cambodia and would feel honored if I could buy you a beer while I was in town.', '2005-02-07 21:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1156096, 144265, 18194, '<td valign="top">Ok, I have look at this and come back and looked again and come back and looked once more, I don''t see sex here. I am sure I am missing something. Taking this at face value it does not seem all that interesting to me.</td>', 'Ok, I have look at this and come back and looked again and come back and looked once more, I don''t see sex here. I am sure I am missing something. Taking this at face value it does not seem all that interesting to me.', '2005-02-07 21:52:54.000000', NULL, 1),
