(1156100, 143967, 25232, '<td valign="top">Where do you find butterfly peas open this time of year?</td>', 'Where do you find butterfly peas open this time of year?', '2005-02-07 21:54:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1156101, 144400, 21362, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.<br/> <br/>I''d crop the bottom off, up to where the hills start making it a "landscape" orientation. I think it looks even better without any of that pink water in it. If I scroll my screen down to crop the bottom off, it looks really excellent! Somehow that water pulls the eye away from what should be the focus -- the gorgous sky with the silouette of the tree in front.</td>', 'Very pretty. I''d crop the bottom off, up to where the hills start making it a "landscape" orientation. I think it looks even better without any of that pink water in it. If I scroll my screen down to crop the bottom off, it looks really excellent! Somehow that water pulls the eye away from what should be the focus -- the gorgous sky with the silouette of the tree in front.', '2005-02-07 21:54:16.000000', NULL, 1),
