(1156353, 144046, 17103, '<td valign="top">I think this would have been better if it had been in focus so the texture would be more apparent.</td>', 'I think this would have been better if it had been in focus so the texture would be more apparent.', '2005-02-07 23:57:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1156354, 144204, 21367, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot, ligthing is very good.  I like this one a lot.  The only thing that I might have done would have been to straighten the pic to where the vase stem and that line light/dark (wall behind the blind on right) were Straight up and down (perpendicular to the bottom edge of photo).   The shadows would retain the effect (perspective) and the vase would not appear to fall over at any moment.  Nice work.</td>', 'Excellent shot, ligthing is very good.  I like this one a lot.  The only thing that I might have done would have been to straighten the pic to where the vase stem and that line light/dark (wall behind the blind on right) were Straight up and down (perpendicular to the bottom edge of photo).   The shadows would retain the effect (perspective) and the vase would not appear to fall over at any moment.  Nice work.', '2005-02-07 23:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1156360, 144423, 29009, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Excellent composition and color, focus is sharp...overall a great photo. (10)</td>', 'Wow!  Excellent composition and color, focus is sharp...overall a great photo. (10)', '2005-02-08 00:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
