(1156364, 143976, 25140, '<td valign="top">A wonderful high key image. I know I''m being picky, but her black toes are bugging me.  I really like your idea and its execution - 9.</td>', 'A wonderful high key image. I know I''m being picky, but her black toes are bugging me.  I really like your idea and its execution - 9.', '2005-02-08 00:01:15.000000', NULL, 1),
