(1156429, 142985, 25140, '<td valign="top">This is a nice idea.  I''m not so sure about the composition, I think it could be more interesting, perhaps doing more the the bag''s reflections and a different angle.</td>', 'This is a nice idea.  I''m not so sure about the composition, I think it could be more interesting, perhaps doing more the the bag''s reflections and a different angle.', '2005-02-08 00:19:49.000000', NULL, 1),
