(1156447, 142894, 17103, '<td valign="top">This looks more like deep orange-peach rather than pink, and I think it could be improved with more depth of field to get the detail at the top of the bud in focus.</td>', 'This looks more like deep orange-peach rather than pink, and I think it could be improved with more depth of field to get the detail at the top of the bud in focus.', '2005-02-08 00:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
