(1156450, 143762, 17103, '<td valign="top">A very orangy-peach color rather than pink.  There''s probably more pink in the neck and head feathers, but unfortunately they''re either blown out or in shadow.</td>', 'A very orangy-peach color rather than pink.  There''s probably more pink in the neck and head feathers, but unfortunately they''re either blown out or in shadow.', '2005-02-08 00:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1156451, 144433, 25464, '<td valign="top">The line formed by the (stick?) brown thing on the left leaving the top of the frame pulls your eye out of the frame.  Also the blurred gray fish is distracting as well.</td>', 'The line formed by the (stick?) brown thing on the left leaving the top of the frame pulls your eye out of the frame.  Also the blurred gray fish is distracting as well.', '2005-02-08 00:28:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1156452, 143748, 29009, '<td valign="top">This is a very creative take, both on the challenge and in general.  I especially like the connotation that the inside of a crayon is liquid.  I gave this an (8) but would have scored it higher if the lighting had been just a little bit brighter.and the pink crayon had been in the same sharp focus as the other crayons.  Perhaps you did this intentionally?  If so, I''m not sure it works as well as you intended.  Overall, this shot made me smile.  Thanks for your submission!</td>', 'This is a very creative take, both on the challenge and in general.  I especially like the connotation that the inside of a crayon is liquid.  I gave this an (8) but would have scored it higher if the lighting had been just a little bit brighter.and the pink crayon had been in the same sharp focus as the other crayons.  Perhaps you did this intentionally?  If so, I''m not sure it works as well as you intended.  Overall, this shot made me smile.  Thanks for your submission!', '2005-02-08 00:28:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1156455, 143847, 29009, '<td valign="top">Good composition and use of lighting here.</td>', 'Good composition and use of lighting here.', '2005-02-08 00:29:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1156456, 143093, 25140, '<td valign="top">A gritty image with a touch of pink, that''s great.  It gives your photo tension, the way the cross is illuminated is nice too.</td>', 'A gritty image with a touch of pink, that''s great.  It gives your photo tension, the way the cross is illuminated is nice too.', '2005-02-08 00:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1156457, 144369, 17103, '<td valign="top">I think more light on the center of the flower to bring out the detail could improve this shot.  Also, it looks orangy-peach on my monitor rather than pink.</td>', 'I think more light on the center of the flower to bring out the detail could improve this shot.  Also, it looks orangy-peach on my monitor rather than pink.', '2005-02-08 00:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
