(1156466, 144419, 29009, '<td valign="top">Good composition and lighting here.  I gave you an (8) because the focus is too soft for my own personal taste given the stark background.  Nice work - I''m sure you are pleased with the final result.</td>', 'Good composition and lighting here.  I gave you an (8) because the focus is too soft for my own personal taste given the stark background.  Nice work - I''m sure you are pleased with the final result.', '2005-02-08 00:32:59.000000', NULL, 1),
