(1156471, 142900, 29009, '<td valign="top">Good capture of emotion (sneaking a peek) without the facial expressions.  I would have scored this a point higher if the entire frame had been in focus.  While I''m sure the DOF was intentional on your part, the visual interest for me was the pair of people rather than the object of their attention.</td>', 'Good capture of emotion (sneaking a peek) without the facial expressions.  I would have scored this a point higher if the entire frame had been in focus.  While I''m sure the DOF was intentional on your part, the visual interest for me was the pair of people rather than the object of their attention.', '2005-02-08 00:35:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1156472, 144490, 25140, '<td valign="top">That kind of flower is stinky without the smokes.  An interesting and amusing idea with a nice execution.</td>', 'That kind of flower is stinky without the smokes.  An interesting and amusing idea with a nice execution.', '2005-02-08 00:36:42.000000', NULL, 1),
