(1157746, 143325, 28108, '<td valign="top">Flower shots rarely inspire me so when there are exeptions, I like to comment on them. This picture is really great because it suggests more than a flower. It looks like a shy woman with her chin down and her hand being brought to the base of her neck. the lighting is awsome. It''s very suggestive and it''s going in my favorites!</td>', 'Flower shots rarely inspire me so when there are exeptions, I like to comment on them. This picture is really great because it suggests more than a flower. It looks like a shy woman with her chin down and her hand being brought to the base of her neck. the lighting is awsome. It''s very suggestive and it''s going in my favorites!', '2005-02-08 16:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
