(1157782, 144404, 16106, '<td valign="top">I thought sautern was supposed to be a tawny gold, this looks more like ripple. Even the reflection of the light that on the front of the bottle is white, on the back of the bottle becomes pink. If you are going to color shift to respond to the challenge, a lighter touch is called for.</td>', 'I thought sautern was supposed to be a tawny gold, this looks more like ripple. Even the reflection of the light that on the front of the bottle is white, on the back of the bottle becomes pink. If you are going to color shift to respond to the challenge, a lighter touch is called for.', '2005-02-08 17:08:30.000000', NULL, 1),
