(1157801, 143446, 17203, '<td valign="top">There are only a handful of DPCers even <i>capable</i> of pulling off a shot like this (and they''re probably all among my favorites). Looks like Kiwiness'' handiwork to me. Concept, lighting and composition are all top-notch. Early congrats on your ribbon! 10</td>', 'There are only a handful of DPCers even capable of pulling off a shot like this (and they''re probably all among my favorites). Looks like Kiwiness'' handiwork to me. Concept, lighting and composition are all top-notch. Early congrats on your ribbon! 10', '2005-02-08 17:16:43.000000', NULL, 1),
