(1157837, 144516, 5112, '<td valign="top">Hmmm ... could this be a "librodo"?  As usual, beautiful picture, well executed - great colour, beautiful use of DOF.  You have a way with eyes.  What lens do you use of these people closeups?  If you have the time, I would love to know.  [10]</td>', 'Hmmm ... could this be a "librodo"?  As usual, beautiful picture, well executed - great colour, beautiful use of DOF.  You have a way with eyes.  What lens do you use of these people closeups?  If you have the time, I would love to know.  [10]', '2005-02-08 17:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1157840, 143489, 5112, '<td valign="top">What a cute shot, love it.  Have you tried getting a touch closer (top and left side, to eliminate the green), maybe showing only part of the hat?  I don''t know if it would work, but I think it might be worth trying.  Her eyes are lovely, as are her freckles.  [9]</td>', 'What a cute shot, love it.  Have you tried getting a touch closer (top and left side, to eliminate the green), maybe showing only part of the hat?  I don''t know if it would work, but I think it might be worth trying.  Her eyes are lovely, as are her freckles.  [9]', '2005-02-08 17:32:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1157841, 144219, 5112, '<td valign="top">I betcha he had fun doing this shoot!  The desaturation works well here.  Love his expression!  [8]</td>', 'I betcha he had fun doing this shoot!  The desaturation works well here.  Love his expression!  [8]', '2005-02-08 17:33:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1157843, 144407, 26756, '<td valign="top">The concept for the photo is okay.  Model is beautiful, you have met the challenge description with no problems and it''s a creative idea.  But here is where I think it could improve:  First of all, the background sheet is distracting and also a bit contrived to me.  It just doesn''t look like a realistic setting.  Second is the harsh lighting.  I think it would have been more effective if it was somehow softer. I know not everyone has a pro studio, myself included, but I just think this photo could have been drastically better without that white backdrop and maybe with a softer, more natural looking light.<br/>Oh, and be prepared to lose about 2 full points after the anti-nudity crowd gets done with you.</td>', 'The concept for the photo is okay.  Model is beautiful, you have met the challenge description with no problems and it''s a creative idea.  But here is where I think it could improve:  First of all, the background sheet is distracting and also a bit contrived to me.  It just doesn''t look like a realistic setting.  Second is the harsh lighting.  I think it would have been more effective if it was somehow softer. I know not everyone has a pro studio, myself included, but I just think this photo could have been drastically better without that white backdrop and maybe with a softer, more natural looking light.Oh, and be prepared to lose about 2 full points after the anti-nudity crowd gets done with you.', '2005-02-08 17:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1157858, 144326, 20330, '<td valign="top">nice detail, but something about the dark lighting doesnt feel right... 7</td>', 'nice detail, but something about the dark lighting doesnt feel right... 7', '2005-02-08 17:43:51.000000', NULL, 1),
