(1158221, 143548, 21202, '<td valign="top">I am setting here saying that I can get this if I put my mind to it.  The lighting on the stem and follded back petals is very nice. The bud seems inadequate and the lighting on the glass is not flattering to it.  A 5, I do like the lighting in the upper half.</td>', 'I am setting here saying that I can get this if I put my mind to it.  The lighting on the stem and follded back petals is very nice. The bud seems inadequate and the lighting on the glass is not flattering to it.  A 5, I do like the lighting in the upper half.', '2005-02-08 20:51:43.000000', NULL, 1),
