(1158355, 144433, 17507, '<td valign="top">I like that you described the anemone as "thing."<br/>(they are actually tidal creatures, too, so they''re not *really* from the deep. just from the water.)<br/>( :P )</td>', 'I like that you described the anemone as "thing."(they are actually tidal creatures, too, so they''re not *really* from the deep. just from the water.)( :P )', '2005-02-08 22:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1158356, 144219, 23478, '<td valign="top">Laurie, great photo... It should do well.</td>', 'Laurie, great photo... It should do well.', '2005-02-08 22:30:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1158358, 144421, 17507, '<td valign="top">AHH DROOLING RODENTS<br/>never occured to me how puckered a possum''s lips are.<br/>i think that''s a possum.</td>', 'AHH DROOLING RODENTSnever occured to me how puckered a possum''s lips are.i think that''s a possum.', '2005-02-08 22:31:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1158362, 144432, 17507, '<td valign="top">Not sure why the rotation was done. I don''t think it helps. The house looks too much like a house for this to work as an abstraction; it just looks like a rotated photograph.</td>', 'Not sure why the rotation was done. I don''t think it helps. The house looks too much like a house for this to work as an abstraction; it just looks like a rotated photograph.', '2005-02-08 22:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1158364, 142932, 17507, '<td valign="top">Fun!<br/>I wish the glasses were in focus. I''d rather have the glasses focused than the map in the background (though the parts of the map seen through the lenses would, ideally, be in focus as well.</td>', 'Fun!I wish the glasses were in focus. I''d rather have the glasses focused than the map in the background (though the parts of the map seen through the lenses would, ideally, be in focus as well.', '2005-02-08 22:33:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1158406, 143895, 31895, '<td valign="top">Great focus and idea!</td>', 'Great focus and idea!', '2005-02-08 23:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1158410, 143905, 31895, '<td valign="top">love the title and the slippers...adorable pic!</td>', 'love the title and the slippers...adorable pic!', '2005-02-08 23:06:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1158411, 144516, 31895, '<td valign="top">amazing detail and excellent model</td>', 'amazing detail and excellent model', '2005-02-08 23:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1158413, 144042, 28261, '<td valign="top">What a great baby shot!  This one should be a poster!  Border not distracting, but also not needed.  Would improve the end quality for me at least a point.</td>', 'What a great baby shot!  This one should be a poster!  Border not distracting, but also not needed.  Would improve the end quality for me at least a point.', '2005-02-08 23:09:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1158416, 143446, 21367, '<td valign="top">Awsome, lighting and tones perfect, placement of subject great, I like the square crop and negative space, and the board adds to the presentation.  You got the total package here...My top pick.</td>', 'Awsome, lighting and tones perfect, placement of subject great, I like the square crop and negative space, and the board adds to the presentation.  You got the total package here...My top pick.', '2005-02-08 23:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1158426, 144521, 21367, '<td valign="top">Interesting Idea...Lighting seems a little harsh.  If I was to shoot this I might have tried a different angle.  Crouch down around the bottom right of the cutting board and shoot across the subject.  Show a little more thickness of the meat and the cutting board.  This might have cut down on the glare in that hot spot in the middle and added some depth to the presentation.</td>', 'Interesting Idea...Lighting seems a little harsh.  If I was to shoot this I might have tried a different angle.  Crouch down around the bottom right of the cutting board and shoot across the subject.  Show a little more thickness of the meat and the cutting board.  This might have cut down on the glare in that hot spot in the middle and added some depth to the presentation.', '2005-02-08 23:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1158447, 142439, 21367, '<td valign="top">The pink bucket would have worked in this challenge but maybe in a more interesting environment. I might have had the wife, neighbor or someone put it over their head doing something goofy but making the bucket the center piece of the shot.  Technically this is an ok shot.  I just would have had a little more in the picture to make the bucket stand out.</td>', 'The pink bucket would have worked in this challenge but maybe in a more interesting environment. I might have had the wife, neighbor or someone put it over their head doing something goofy but making the bucket the center piece of the shot.  Technically this is an ok shot.  I just would have had a little more in the picture to make the bucket stand out.', '2005-02-08 23:29:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1158450, 144350, 14448, '<td valign="top">To me, it is yellow and not pink, that is the main colour in this image, so it fails to meet the challenge.  Otherwise, composition and technicals are good.</td>', 'To me, it is yellow and not pink, that is the main colour in this image, so it fails to meet the challenge.  Otherwise, composition and technicals are good.', '2005-02-08 23:29:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1158458, 144515, 29404, '<td valign="top">great great image...wonderfull shot that works great for me</td>', 'great great image...wonderfull shot that works great for me', '2005-02-08 23:32:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1158459, 144278, 21367, '<td valign="top">The concept is right, but I would have somehow went the other direction with the dof.  The Antenna takes the stage here and the "pink" radio takes backseat.  I like the colors that you have captured in this shot.  Cool concept and title.</td>', 'The concept is right, but I would have somehow went the other direction with the dof.  The Antenna takes the stage here and the "pink" radio takes backseat.  I like the colors that you have captured in this shot.  Cool concept and title.', '2005-02-08 23:32:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1158460, 144521, 14448, '<td valign="top">Well, there''s some pink there, but otherwise I struggle with this image and see  problems with sharpness, overblown highlights, clashing colours and textures, and extraneous elements in the composition.</td>', 'Well, there''s some pink there, but otherwise I struggle with this image and see  problems with sharpness, overblown highlights, clashing colours and textures, and extraneous elements in the composition.', '2005-02-08 23:32:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1158465, 143859, 29404, '<td valign="top">very very beautifull...wonderfull</td>', 'very very beautifull...wonderfull', '2005-02-08 23:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1158466, 143954, 14448, '<td valign="top">Wish the horizon line didn''t seem tilted, but otherwise a well executed  interesting composition.</td>', 'Wish the horizon line didn''t seem tilted, but otherwise a well executed  interesting composition.', '2005-02-08 23:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1158469, 142430, 14448, '<td valign="top">Good idea, well executed.</td>', 'Good idea, well executed.', '2005-02-08 23:35:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1158472, 144274, 29404, '<td valign="top">very nice composition</td>', 'very nice composition', '2005-02-08 23:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1158473, 144383, 14448, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately looks orange rather than pink on my monitor.  Otherwise, I like the composition, and the interesting textures and details.  Well executed.</td>', 'Unfortunately looks orange rather than pink on my monitor.  Otherwise, I like the composition, and the interesting textures and details.  Well executed.', '2005-02-08 23:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1158504, 143878, 21367, '<td valign="top">The destat works well here...May be just a dab like of pink on the cheek would work here (the smear is very strong and forces the viewer to that area)  but viewers here at dpc might not put the two together (title and dab of pink).  I think you could have got away with just the subtle pink lipstick and have a very good pic.  The expression of the model and her eye''s tell a story of their own.  I might have done the crop with less negative space on the right and just a tad bit more below the lips.  Technical a good shot.</td>', 'The destat works well here...May be just a dab like of pink on the cheek would work here (the smear is very strong and forces the viewer to that area)  but viewers here at dpc might not put the two together (title and dab of pink).  I think you could have got away with just the subtle pink lipstick and have a very good pic.  The expression of the model and her eye''s tell a story of their own.  I might have done the crop with less negative space on the right and just a tad bit more below the lips.  Technical a good shot.', '2005-02-08 23:48:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1158518, 144210, 21367, '<td valign="top">On this one I think I might have got a little closer to bring out the pink bud, macro of just the bud and that first set of leaves around it.  The crop that you have is very good for a floral shot, nice boke, subject off center...for this pink challenge for me there is too much going on around the edges of the shot.  Even thought the background leaves are out of focus the white tips of the leaves grab my attention and draw me away from your pink subject.  This is a very nice composition, but for this challenge I think it would do better if closer to where the bud dominated the picture.  Just my thoughts.</td>', 'On this one I think I might have got a little closer to bring out the pink bud, macro of just the bud and that first set of leaves around it.  The crop that you have is very good for a floral shot, nice boke, subject off center...for this pink challenge for me there is too much going on around the edges of the shot.  Even thought the background leaves are out of focus the white tips of the leaves grab my attention and draw me away from your pink subject.  This is a very nice composition, but for this challenge I think it would do better if closer to where the bud dominated the picture.  Just my thoughts.', '2005-02-08 23:58:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1158570, 143872, 33140, '<td valign="top">This is awesome</td>', 'This is awesome', '2005-02-09 00:10:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1158579, 144412, 21367, '<td valign="top">Actually a quite interesting shot.   You captured some interesting shapes and patterns within the bubble.  This being an advanced challenge I might have rotated the picture 180 degrees to show what looks like heart shapes within the bubble.  As the picture is I might have done a tighter crop on the bottom, and exposed a little more of that long stringy part on top.</td>', 'Actually a quite interesting shot.   You captured some interesting shapes and patterns within the bubble.  This being an advanced challenge I might have rotated the picture 180 degrees to show what looks like heart shapes within the bubble.  As the picture is I might have done a tighter crop on the bottom, and exposed a little more of that long stringy part on top.', '2005-02-09 00:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1158593, 144042, 21367, '<td valign="top">Nice cute picture.  For me there just seems to be too much white making the skin tones (pink) a very small part of the composition.   I might have have done a 5x7 crop (vertically) and omitted the bed railing that is just a tad bit distracting.  Still a very calm, peaceful photo.</td>', 'Nice cute picture.  For me there just seems to be too much white making the skin tones (pink) a very small part of the composition.   I might have have done a 5x7 crop (vertically) and omitted the bed railing that is just a tad bit distracting.  Still a very calm, peaceful photo.', '2005-02-09 00:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1158623, 143954, 21367, '<td valign="top">Nice, clean and technically well done shot.  This couldn''t have been taken any better (technically).  I like the concept and execution but for some reason it just doesn''t put me over edge.  Can''t quite put my finger on it maybe the square, rectange and lines are making this a too perfect picture, too organized or calculated.  Don''t get me wrong, I do like the shot and gave it high score but couldn''t put it on top.</td>', 'Nice, clean and technically well done shot.  This couldn''t have been taken any better (technically).  I like the concept and execution but for some reason it just doesn''t put me over edge.  Can''t quite put my finger on it maybe the square, rectange and lines are making this a too perfect picture, too organized or calculated.  Don''t get me wrong, I do like the shot and gave it high score but couldn''t put it on top.', '2005-02-09 00:29:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1158679, 144264, 21367, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool shot, interesting composition to look at.  The light from underneath adds an interesting glow.  I might have done a tighter crop on the model, just a tad right of the shadow on here neck.  A tighter crop would force the viewer back towards the rose.  By having negative space between the two subjects the observer scans back and forth between the rose and the model.   At least for me the brightness of the models shirt keeps drawing me in that directing taking away from the story that you are telling in the shot.  I think eliminating (cropping) a good portion of that lit area would create a better balance and create less competition for the rose.</td>', 'Pretty cool shot, interesting composition to look at.  The light from underneath adds an interesting glow.  I might have done a tighter crop on the model, just a tad right of the shadow on here neck.  A tighter crop would force the viewer back towards the rose.  By having negative space between the two subjects the observer scans back and forth between the rose and the model.   At least for me the brightness of the models shirt keeps drawing me in that directing taking away from the story that you are telling in the shot.  I think eliminating (cropping) a good portion of that lit area would create a better balance and create less competition for the rose.', '2005-02-09 00:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1158777, 142346, 16106, '<td valign="top">The star burst highlights are a great touch! also nice DOF</td>', 'The star burst highlights are a great touch! also nice DOF', '2005-02-09 01:06:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1158849, 142835, 19952, '<td valign="top">Your daughter makes a really beautiful model. Great job with the lighting and composition.</td>', 'Your daughter makes a really beautiful model. Great job with the lighting and composition.', '2005-02-09 01:27:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1158965, 143754, 21362, '<td valign="top">I think this is my favorite of the challenge (other than mine, haha). Nice pretty color, good focus, interesting POV. Not a bad thing to say about it. <br/> <br/>Good luck!</td>', 'I think this is my favorite of the challenge (other than mine, haha). Nice pretty color, good focus, interesting POV. Not a bad thing to say about it.  Good luck!', '2005-02-09 02:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
