(1159665, 144275, 93, '<td valign="top">Peekaboo, I see you!   <br/> <br/>I really hope this ribbons.. Gracie deserves one! (and so do you :))</td>', 'Peekaboo, I see you!    I really hope this ribbons.. Gracie deserves one! (and so do you :))', '2005-02-09 12:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159667, 144453, 30818, '<td valign="top">I must''ve had too much to drink... :)</td>', 'I must''ve had too much to drink... :)', '2005-02-09 12:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159697, 143775, 33061, '<td valign="top">Nice capture</td>', 'Nice capture', '2005-02-09 12:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159699, 144350, 30712, '<td valign="top">For me this is a photograph of a yellow flower and the background is secondary.  Hope you don''t think I''m being too fussy.  The image is superb - love it.</td>', 'For me this is a photograph of a yellow flower and the background is secondary.  Hope you don''t think I''m being too fussy.  The image is superb - love it.', '2005-02-09 12:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159702, 143847, 30712, '<td valign="top">Sorry but I don''t see this flower as being pink so even though it is a superb image it doesn''t really match the subject requirements.</td>', 'Sorry but I don''t see this flower as being pink so even though it is a superb image it doesn''t really match the subject requirements.', '2005-02-09 12:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159704, 143093, 30712, '<td valign="top">I know that it could be argued that black is a lack of colour and that the primary colour here is pink ....... but ....... sorry I can''t go along with that.  Tremendous image in the right place.</td>', 'I know that it could be argued that black is a lack of colour and that the primary colour here is pink ....... but ....... sorry I can''t go along with that.  Tremendous image in the right place.', '2005-02-09 12:25:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159706, 143978, 30712, '<td valign="top">I like red but somehow it doesn''t quite match the subject requirements.  Sorry to be fussy.</td>', 'I like red but somehow it doesn''t quite match the subject requirements.  Sorry to be fussy.', '2005-02-09 12:28:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159710, 144210, 30712, '<td valign="top">I like the plant but however hard I try I can''t make pink the primary colour.  Sorry.</td>', 'I like the plant but however hard I try I can''t make pink the primary colour.  Sorry.', '2005-02-09 12:29:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159737, 143469, 30305, '<td valign="top">nothing with pink    0</td>', 'nothing with pink    0', '2005-02-09 13:03:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159738, 144521, 30305, '<td valign="top">interesting  4</td>', 'interesting  4', '2005-02-09 13:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159750, 143461, 27375, '<td valign="top">cute...and you get your point across well. Best one of the candy hearts so far. Now I just hope I can get that song out of my head.</td>', 'cute...and you get your point across well. Best one of the candy hearts so far. Now I just hope I can get that song out of my head.', '2005-02-09 13:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159779, 143859, 22046, '<td valign="top">I would crop off some of the top to focus on the pink birds and their pink reflections. Nice photo.</td>', 'I would crop off some of the top to focus on the pink birds and their pink reflections. Nice photo.', '2005-02-09 13:38:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159783, 143559, 16488, '<td valign="top">You spotted a lovely subject, but then... <br/> <br/>The water droplets are a bit distracting--if applied, then a bit heavy on the mister--if not, then a paint brush would help reduce and refine them before shooting.  DOF shows control, but the vertical stem and far leaf show color fringing--perhaps a processing artifact.  Pink frame fights for attention--it''s not just a DPC thing--use frames to contain your subject and subtly enhance and you''ll do better.</td>', 'You spotted a lovely subject, but then...  The water droplets are a bit distracting--if applied, then a bit heavy on the mister--if not, then a paint brush would help reduce and refine them before shooting.  DOF shows control, but the vertical stem and far leaf show color fringing--perhaps a processing artifact.  Pink frame fights for attention--it''s not just a DPC thing--use frames to contain your subject and subtly enhance and you''ll do better.', '2005-02-09 13:39:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1159785, 143832, 16488, '<td valign="top">Lovely and romantically played.  Alstromeria was my wedding flower choice--so I''m endeared by your photo.  Quibble with the upper left corner where the one blossom is too dark for the rest of the composition--it pulls the eye out of the frame.</td>', 'Lovely and romantically played.  Alstromeria was my wedding flower choice--so I''m endeared by your photo.  Quibble with the upper left corner where the one blossom is too dark for the rest of the composition--it pulls the eye out of the frame.', '2005-02-09 13:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
