(1160889, 144237, 17507, '<td valign="top">great choice of subject, but i think a different angle and tighter crop, focusing on the folds, would have worked better.</td>', 'great choice of subject, but i think a different angle and tighter crop, focusing on the folds, would have worked better.', '2005-02-09 21:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1160892, 143469, 27847, '<td valign="top">Love the shot, interesting approach to the pink challenge and I''m sure you have gotten plenty of ''pink is not the primary color...'' which I agree with. However, I like the photo makes you go hmmm. The lighting does need a little improvement especially where it''s overexposed on the nose. Things like that draw the person to look in that location and I personally don''t think it''s flattering in this photo. That''s how we learn ... from comments. Keep up the good work!</td>', 'Love the shot, interesting approach to the pink challenge and I''m sure you have gotten plenty of ''pink is not the primary color...'' which I agree with. However, I like the photo makes you go hmmm. The lighting does need a little improvement especially where it''s overexposed on the nose. Things like that draw the person to look in that location and I personally don''t think it''s flattering in this photo. That''s how we learn ... from comments. Keep up the good work!', '2005-02-09 21:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1160901, 144356, 27847, '<td valign="top">Nice photo and it is certainly pink in my opinion. Except that I find it had a little too much over saturation done on the pink, you can really notice it in the left bottom corner of the photo. Still intrigue photo.</td>', 'Nice photo and it is certainly pink in my opinion. Except that I find it had a little too much over saturation done on the pink, you can really notice it in the left bottom corner of the photo. Still intrigue photo.', '2005-02-09 21:58:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1160904, 144514, 27847, '<td valign="top">Attractive abstract shot here, in my opinion. I do find the water drop and/or whatever that is on the left-middle part of the petal very distracting. Still wonderfull macro.</td>', 'Attractive abstract shot here, in my opinion. I do find the water drop and/or whatever that is on the left-middle part of the petal very distracting. Still wonderfull macro.', '2005-02-09 22:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1160911, 144042, 27847, '<td valign="top">Very gorgeous baby you have here, seems content ... oh that''s right it''s sleeping  ;-) Anyway I think that the light is too bright and it''s taking away from the baby''s pink skin (which I think was the intent of this photo). Yes, very cute baby.</td>', 'Very gorgeous baby you have here, seems content ... oh that''s right it''s sleeping  ;-) Anyway I think that the light is too bright and it''s taking away from the baby''s pink skin (which I think was the intent of this photo). Yes, very cute baby.', '2005-02-09 22:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1160913, 144526, 17507, '<td valign="top">nice picture, but the stripey thing is weird and the pink border is :(</td>', 'nice picture, but the stripey thing is weird and the pink border is :(', '2005-02-09 22:05:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1160919, 144447, 26756, '<td valign="top">There are parts of this photo that I think could be a little sharper, but the exposure is very nice.  While I think the composition turned out to be a bit busy and distracting, you did make a big effort to arrange them in a way you don''t normally see, and that was very creative.  Good effort.</td>', 'There are parts of this photo that I think could be a little sharper, but the exposure is very nice.  While I think the composition turned out to be a bit busy and distracting, you did make a big effort to arrange them in a way you don''t normally see, and that was very creative.  Good effort.', '2005-02-09 22:08:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1160925, 142765, 27847, '<td valign="top">Great macro shot here with intesting selective desaturation. The iris does seem on the dark-pink side almost a purple color and I thing for me corping it the other way might have worked better. Still like this marco shot.</td>', 'Great macro shot here with intesting selective desaturation. The iris does seem on the dark-pink side almost a purple color and I thing for me corping it the other way might have worked better. Still like this marco shot.', '2005-02-09 22:09:12.000000', NULL, 1),
