(1162718, 142835, 17851, '<td valign="top">Wonderful photograph! Love the tonality of the skin aswell as the great side lighting!....at first I was unsure if this really fit the challenge,  but now I can see that the skin has a very light soft pink :) ... one of my top picks Good luck!</td>', 'Wonderful photograph! Love the tonality of the skin aswell as the great side lighting!....at first I was unsure if this really fit the challenge,  but now I can see that the skin has a very light soft pink :) ... one of my top picks Good luck!', '2005-02-10 23:15:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1162720, 143093, 18349, '<td valign="top">This is a hauntingly beautiful image.  The textures and the shadows make it surreal but very physical.  I hope it''s not suffering the wrath of the "OMG it has to be stock pretty" voters.  It smacks of a JPR image.  Absolutely wonderful.  :o)</td>', 'This is a hauntingly beautiful image.  The textures and the shadows make it surreal but very physical.  I hope it''s not suffering the wrath of the "OMG it has to be stock pretty" voters.  It smacks of a JPR image.  Absolutely wonderful.  :o)', '2005-02-10 23:15:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1162724, 142865, 17851, '<td valign="top">Excelent Portrait!, I love the subtle tone of the pink, lighting is also wonderful here...best of luck :)</td>', 'Excelent Portrait!, I love the subtle tone of the pink, lighting is also wonderful here...best of luck :)', '2005-02-10 23:18:43.000000', NULL, 1),
