(1163168, 143743, 2798, '<td valign="top">Lovely and simple. Interesting light. Looks like you have a gold reflector down to the left. I think in this (rare) case where we''re looking for pink it would have been better to keep to a single colour of light. But this is major nit picking on my part. Well done. a solid 9 for me.</td>', 'Lovely and simple. Interesting light. Looks like you have a gold reflector down to the left. I think in this (rare) case where we''re looking for pink it would have been better to keep to a single colour of light. But this is major nit picking on my part. Well done. a solid 9 for me.', '2005-02-11 07:55:09.000000', NULL, 1),
