(1164147, 143912, 27847, '<td valign="top">This shot has possibilities especially if it was shot at the wide angle; it''s a little to tight for my taste. It draws me right to the tree which in case is not the mine subject since it''s not pink! The tree should have been offset to one of the sides and given more room for the background sunset.</td>', 'This shot has possibilities especially if it was shot at the wide angle; it''s a little to tight for my taste. It draws me right to the tree which in case is not the mine subject since it''s not pink! The tree should have been offset to one of the sides and given more room for the background sunset.', '2005-02-11 18:21:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1164157, 144257, 27847, '<td valign="top">Excellent portrait photo, great lighting and over all the model seems very confident in front of the lens. Would have been great, but you''re probably getting punished for the pink not being the primary color. Still, great work.</td>', 'Excellent portrait photo, great lighting and over all the model seems very confident in front of the lens. Would have been great, but you''re probably getting punished for the pink not being the primary color. Still, great work.', '2005-02-11 18:27:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1164170, 144434, 27847, '<td valign="top">Well it''s not flowers ;-). But it''s just not working for me and it caused by the lighting. It''s just all over the place too bright, too many shadows from the shirt and the dark shadows on the bottom right. It would have been better shot if the person was laying down and the light was shined from above and shot that way. Good Luck.</td>', 'Well it''s not flowers ;-). But it''s just not working for me and it caused by the lighting. It''s just all over the place too bright, too many shadows from the shirt and the dark shadows on the bottom right. It would have been better shot if the person was laying down and the light was shined from above and shot that way. Good Luck.', '2005-02-11 18:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
