(1164567, 142850, 21362, '<td valign="top">I bet this is getting a lot of unfair votes, like cat photos always do.  I like it though. I''d probably spot edit the little specks of dust out of his fur, and maybe try to darken the black a little bit. But it''s cute -- the curious personality of the cat is nice, and I like the way the curtains and cat break the frame up into thirds.</td>', 'I bet this is getting a lot of unfair votes, like cat photos always do.  I like it though. I''d probably spot edit the little specks of dust out of his fur, and maybe try to darken the black a little bit. But it''s cute -- the curious personality of the cat is nice, and I like the way the curtains and cat break the frame up into thirds.', '2005-02-12 00:22:16.000000', NULL, 1),
