(1164761, 143945, 27847, '<td valign="top">Looks like you don''t have a happy camper here however a very compling facial shot. Over all I like it but I think a little more light on the face would have had better results. Still, good work.</td>', 'Looks like you don''t have a happy camper here however a very compling facial shot. Over all I like it but I think a little more light on the face would have had better results. Still, good work.', '2005-02-12 05:27:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1164764, 144413, 27847, '<td valign="top">Beautiful caputre, great sky and postion of the lonely tree. I think the only thing I would have done personally is had it cropped a little more so that the ground is leveled as oppose to the slight slant from left to right (it''s very slight but noticeable). Still excellent work, love it.</td>', 'Beautiful caputre, great sky and postion of the lonely tree. I think the only thing I would have done personally is had it cropped a little more so that the ground is leveled as oppose to the slight slant from left to right (it''s very slight but noticeable). Still excellent work, love it.', '2005-02-12 05:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1164766, 143446, 27847, '<td valign="top">Very interesting composition you have here. One of those shots that require a double and triple glance, and that''s exactly what you want the viewer to be doing. Excellent work and really love the lighting, especially the nice glow around the model.</td>', 'Very interesting composition you have here. One of those shots that require a double and triple glance, and that''s exactly what you want the viewer to be doing. Excellent work and really love the lighting, especially the nice glow around the model.', '2005-02-12 05:33:05.000000', NULL, 1),
