(1164802, 142984, 31133, '<td valign="top">I''m not usually so fond of selective desaturation, but this is beautiful!  My eye is drawn directly to the softness in the center of the rose. If I could change anything, it would be to remove the object in the lower left - can''t tell what it is,  but I think the out of focus diagonals in the upper right work best here.</td>', 'I''m not usually so fond of selective desaturation, but this is beautiful!  My eye is drawn directly to the softness in the center of the rose. If I could change anything, it would be to remove the object in the lower left - can''t tell what it is,  but I think the out of focus diagonals in the upper right work best here.', '2005-02-12 08:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1164803, 143648, 31133, '<td valign="top">I love the glow around the plant - also, I think the orangish tone with the purple works surprisingly well. There are beautiful color transitions here!</td>', 'I love the glow around the plant - also, I think the orangish tone with the purple works surprisingly well. There are beautiful color transitions here!', '2005-02-12 08:05:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1164805, 144285, 31133, '<td valign="top">So sharp and beautifully framed. Puget Sound? This another one that looks better the longer I stare at it. It''s nearly perfect for me. Wouldn''t mind seeing a bit more saturation so it would be more pinkish.</td>', 'So sharp and beautifully framed. Puget Sound? This another one that looks better the longer I stare at it. It''s nearly perfect for me. Wouldn''t mind seeing a bit more saturation so it would be more pinkish.', '2005-02-12 08:07:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1164806, 143954, 31133, '<td valign="top">I love the colors and shapes here! Wish the "closed" sign were as sharp as the guys arms. Love the hat and love the person''s skin tone.</td>', 'I love the colors and shapes here! Wish the "closed" sign were as sharp as the guys arms. Love the hat and love the person''s skin tone.', '2005-02-12 08:09:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1164807, 142457, 31133, '<td valign="top">Nice color! The lack of focus damages the overall effect for me quite a bit, though.</td>', 'Nice color! The lack of focus damages the overall effect for me quite a bit, though.', '2005-02-12 08:10:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1164809, 144356, 31133, '<td valign="top">Whoa, that''s pink! Pink and beautiful. It looks a tad on the grainy side to me, but maybe that''s part of what you wanted. I think the brown tones at the bottom add a lot to this shot.</td>', 'Whoa, that''s pink! Pink and beautiful. It looks a tad on the grainy side to me, but maybe that''s part of what you wanted. I think the brown tones at the bottom add a lot to this shot.', '2005-02-12 08:13:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1164810, 144236, 31133, '<td valign="top">Even though we''ve all got ''em, this is a little too much information for me :-) You sure got the sharpness in there, though.</td>', 'Even though we''ve all got ''em, this is a little too much information for me :-) You sure got the sharpness in there, though.', '2005-02-12 08:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1164811, 144413, 31133, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors that jump right out in this winter scene. I love how there''s only the one tree on the landscape.</td>', 'Beautiful colors that jump right out in this winter scene. I love how there''s only the one tree on the landscape.', '2005-02-12 08:16:37.000000', NULL, 1),
