(1166126, 143489, 22479, '<td valign="top">Overall a nice enough portrait, but I offer a suggestion to fix the cool hue on the face of the girl due to the reflection of blue light off her very blue shirt. That''s really the only major ding in this otherwise fine photograph. Best of luck. 6</td>', 'Overall a nice enough portrait, but I offer a suggestion to fix the cool hue on the face of the girl due to the reflection of blue light off her very blue shirt. That''s really the only major ding in this otherwise fine photograph. Best of luck. 6', '2005-02-13 09:51:02.000000', NULL, 1),
