(1166147, 144422, 22479, '<td valign="top">Why does this need validation? <br/> <br/>It''s a fairly normal appearing shot of a house, with quite a bit of loss of detail underneath the balcony probably due to noise reduction. Overall, a nice shot and a good entry for this challenge.</td>', 'Why does this need validation?  It''s a fairly normal appearing shot of a house, with quite a bit of loss of detail underneath the balcony probably due to noise reduction. Overall, a nice shot and a good entry for this challenge.', '2005-02-13 10:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1166151, 144492, 18367, '<td valign="top">I really liked this one.  Simple, clear, crisp, nice background, and, unlike several of the pics I have seen to date, this one is definitely in keeping with the challenge.  Good luck to you in the challenge. Minimum 7, and I will be back.<br/> <br/>Came back and bumped it up 2.  Great Job.</td>', 'I really liked this one.  Simple, clear, crisp, nice background, and, unlike several of the pics I have seen to date, this one is definitely in keeping with the challenge.  Good luck to you in the challenge. Minimum 7, and I will be back. Came back and bumped it up 2.  Great Job.', '2005-02-13 10:39:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1166157, 144042, 24911, '<td valign="top">Sorry. He is cute, but all I see is white. No Pink.</td>', 'Sorry. He is cute, but all I see is white. No Pink.', '2005-02-13 10:58:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1166221, 143967, 12253, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition and very pretty flower and branch.  Good background and low key frame.  Minor crits: the flower may be a bit overexposed on the left edge and below, or it could just be that stark white.  Also, the stamen area of this flower could be clearer--it seems to have some chroma noise.  (Note: I scored this a few days ago, so if a score coincides with this critique, it isn''t mine.)</td>', 'Excellent composition and very pretty flower and branch.  Good background and low key frame.  Minor crits: the flower may be a bit overexposed on the left edge and below, or it could just be that stark white.  Also, the stamen area of this flower could be clearer--it seems to have some chroma noise.  (Note: I scored this a few days ago, so if a score coincides with this critique, it isn''t mine.)', '2005-02-13 12:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1166226, 142736, 12253, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, and definitely enough pink.  However, this to me seems "flat" as a duotone.  I''d like to have seen some sparkle in the glass,  or something to brighten this up, the pink alone doesn''t do that.  (Note: I scored this a few days ago, so if a score coincides with this critique, it isn''t mine.)</td>', 'Nice idea, and definitely enough pink.  However, this to me seems "flat" as a duotone.  I''d like to have seen some sparkle in the glass,  or something to brighten this up, the pink alone doesn''t do that.  (Note: I scored this a few days ago, so if a score coincides with this critique, it isn''t mine.)', '2005-02-13 12:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1166229, 143974, 12253, '<td valign="top">Good shot of the fish, that''s difficult to capture.  It would be nice to work out better lighting than frontal flash for these shots.  It kind of has a snap shot look as is.  And pink isn''t a strong color in this shot.  (Note: I scored this a few days ago, so if a score coincides with this critique, it isn''t mine.)</td>', 'Good shot of the fish, that''s difficult to capture.  It would be nice to work out better lighting than frontal flash for these shots.  It kind of has a snap shot look as is.  And pink isn''t a strong color in this shot.  (Note: I scored this a few days ago, so if a score coincides with this critique, it isn''t mine.)', '2005-02-13 12:28:03.000000', NULL, 1),
