(1166551, 144301, 3032, '<td valign="top">I like the portrait an sich and the partial desaturation works well here. But there is a bit too much space around her and the composition is to centered. A 5x4 crop might bring a better balance. I think I''d loose some of the space on the left, she needs the space at the right to look into.</td>', 'I like the portrait an sich and the partial desaturation works well here. But there is a bit too much space around her and the composition is to centered. A 5x4 crop might bring a better balance. I think I''d loose some of the space on the left, she needs the space at the right to look into.', '2005-02-13 17:17:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1166552, 144352, 26679, '<td valign="top">I love the composition. The ideas and exicution are great.<br/>However pink isn''t just 4girls u know... ;)</td>', 'I love the composition. The ideas and exicution are great.However pink isn''t just 4girls u know... ;)', '2005-02-13 17:18:29.000000', NULL, 1),
