(1166554, 143978, 3032, '<td valign="top">Who doesn''t love pigs? :)<br/>I like the composition, the background and the pink vs black concept.<br/>The contrast is a bit extreme though; burn-out on the nose and ears yet the front is to dark. I think that a second light from the angle towards wich the pigs are looking might help to balance this out and fills the shadows underneat a bit.</td>', 'Who doesn''t love pigs? :)I like the composition, the background and the pink vs black concept.The contrast is a bit extreme though; burn-out on the nose and ears yet the front is to dark. I think that a second light from the angle towards wich the pigs are looking might help to balance this out and fills the shadows underneat a bit.', '2005-02-13 17:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1166557, 144519, 26679, '<td valign="top">Great idea, and the pink does stand out well.<br/>If you are going to give a copy to the model I would use a little bit of cloning to smooth out the imperfections on the neck, and whiten the eye a little...</td>', 'Great idea, and the pink does stand out well.If you are going to give a copy to the model I would use a little bit of cloning to smooth out the imperfections on the neck, and whiten the eye a little...', '2005-02-13 17:22:30.000000', NULL, 1),
