(1166562, 144167, 3032, '<td valign="top">Somehow this is so interesting.<br/>You''ve got this balance between the darker left and the lighter right. The classic objects in the shop window to make this more fifties/sixties (her clothing helps as well). Her hair is intruiging, does she weare a wig? :) I like her smile, she has a looks as if she just fell in love with a T-Bird. Nice work.<br/></td>', 'Somehow this is so interesting.You''ve got this balance between the darker left and the lighter right. The classic objects in the shop window to make this more fifties/sixties (her clothing helps as well). Her hair is intruiging, does she weare a wig? :) I like her smile, she has a looks as if she just fell in love with a T-Bird. Nice work.', '2005-02-13 17:25:16.000000', NULL, 1),
