(1166669, 144250, 3032, '<td valign="top">I should give this a 10 but I promised Sher not to do that. :)<br/> <br/>He he he.<br/>Seriously now: I like the setup, pose and composition. It is just that the face doesn''t stand out good enough (for me). The tone of the skin is a bit too close to the tone (not the color but the strength of the light) to the background. Somehow she reminds me of Princess Leia. <br/> <br/>I will find your selfportrait! :)</td>', 'I should give this a 10 but I promised Sher not to do that. :) He he he.Seriously now: I like the setup, pose and composition. It is just that the face doesn''t stand out good enough (for me). The tone of the skin is a bit too close to the tone (not the color but the strength of the light) to the background. Somehow she reminds me of Princess Leia.  I will find your selfportrait! :)', '2005-02-13 19:06:36.000000', NULL, 1),
