(1167785, 143762, 26669, '<td valign="top">Hi All<br/>Thanks for the comments left on this, <br/>@ coolhar, <br/>colours on this were not post processed or tweaked  image is pretty much as it came out of the camera. I see where your coming from though with the orangeish comment. did not see that before but after seeing other entries it does looking orange? Thanks for pointing out.<br/> <br/>Well onto the next challenge to see if we can up the aveerage score.<br/> <br/>thanks again :-)</td>', 'Hi AllThanks for the comments left on this, @ coolhar, colours on this were not post processed or tweaked  image is pretty much as it came out of the camera. I see where your coming from though with the orangeish comment. did not see that before but after seeing other entries it does looking orange? Thanks for pointing out. Well onto the next challenge to see if we can up the aveerage score. thanks again :-)', '2005-02-14 03:53:15.000000', NULL, 0),
