(1168105, 144009, 6130, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your ribbon with this colorful image.</td>', 'Congrats on your ribbon with this colorful image.', '2005-02-14 07:52:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(1168112, 144219, 13365, '<td valign="top">You rock Laurie!!, Congrats on the top 20!!!</td>', 'You rock Laurie!!, Congrats on the top 20!!!', '2005-02-14 07:56:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(1168156, 144219, 17033, '<td valign="top">Well done! Very refreshing to see this picture: a real person and great sense of humour. It really shows up the many artificial/melodramatic entries that appeared in this challenge. Should have done better.</td>', 'Well done! Very refreshing to see this picture: a real person and great sense of humour. It really shows up the many artificial/melodramatic entries that appeared in this challenge. Should have done better.', '2005-02-14 08:28:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(1168166, 142865, 15497, '<td valign="top">Wow! I totally missed this one.. Great capture heida! Congrats on the endless row of ribbons! :)<br/> <br/></td>', 'Wow! I totally missed this one.. Great capture heida! Congrats on the endless row of ribbons! :) ', '2005-02-14 08:37:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(1168177, 142835, 8522, '<td valign="top">Your talent continues to astound me. I can''t believe this didn''t win.</td>', 'Your talent continues to astound me. I can''t believe this didn''t win.', '2005-02-14 08:44:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(1168182, 144009, 11181, '<td valign="top">WTG Kylie!!! Congrats!!!</td>', 'WTG Kylie!!! Congrats!!!', '2005-02-14 08:49:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(1168189, 142439, 31440, '<td valign="top">I liked this a fair bit, it was something different.  It''s amazing some people seemed to vote you down because they didn''t think the color was perfect.</td>', 'I liked this a fair bit, it was something different.  It''s amazing some people seemed to vote you down because they didn''t think the color was perfect.', '2005-02-14 08:53:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(1168196, 143945, 2344, '<td valign="top">if you''re having a hard time distinguishing what it is that didn''t quite bump this picture up into the realm of top 10 you should re-read dartompkins'' comment. The fact that this image is underexposed makes the colours look a bit drab. The little girl''s expression isn''t exactly conveying that pink is her favourite colour. I hope this helps a little bit.</td>', 'if you''re having a hard time distinguishing what it is that didn''t quite bump this picture up into the realm of top 10 you should re-read dartompkins'' comment. The fact that this image is underexposed makes the colours look a bit drab. The little girl''s expression isn''t exactly conveying that pink is her favourite colour. I hope this helps a little bit.', '2005-02-14 08:59:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(1168218, 144009, 24065, '<td valign="top">Kylie, I''ve been without internet at home so just saw this when I got to work this AM.  I am soooooo happy for you!  This was a great photo and a well-deserved ribbon.  Congratulations.</td>', 'Kylie, I''ve been without internet at home so just saw this when I got to work this AM.  I am soooooo happy for you!  This was a great photo and a well-deserved ribbon.  Congratulations.', '2005-02-14 09:11:20.000000', NULL, 0),
