(1169606, 143446, 332, '<td valign="top">Thanks to all of you for taking the time to comment on my picture. It is always fun to finish first when having spent some time in the setup and lighting. I took this shot in the beginning of the week so I had plenty of time deciding on the right crop, border and warmth. One of my favorite shots ever. The girl on the photo is Audur, my girlfriend. You will probably see plenty more of her in the future on this site :)<br/> <br/>Thanks again for your great comments. I got some more close ups and variations. Perhaps I will post some of them here. Also got a shot of the setup.</td>', 'Thanks to all of you for taking the time to comment on my picture. It is always fun to finish first when having spent some time in the setup and lighting. I took this shot in the beginning of the week so I had plenty of time deciding on the right crop, border and warmth. One of my favorite shots ever. The girl on the photo is Audur, my girlfriend. You will probably see plenty more of her in the future on this site :) Thanks again for your great comments. I got some more close ups and variations. Perhaps I will post some of them here. Also got a shot of the setup.', '2005-02-14 19:48:25.000000', NULL, 0),
