(1175111, 144009, 20779, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Caeclyd:</b></div><hr/><i> " cloned out some background clutter on the left"<br/> <br/>Um I thought cloning was a No No ? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I PM''d you also, but thought I''d leave a comment here, too. It is fine to remove "minor distractions" in a "member" challenge, but big no-no in an "open" challenge.</td>', 'Originally posted by Caeclyd: " cloned out some background clutter on the left" Um I thought cloning was a No No ?   I PM''d you also, but thought I''d leave a comment here, too. It is fine to remove "minor distractions" in a "member" challenge, but big no-no in an "open" challenge.', '2005-02-16 15:52:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(1175193, 144009, 31501, '<td valign="top">I think your chosen exception to the cloning rule was well deserved based on the outcome of the image.  Nice work; a truly exciting view...very appropriate for the subject matter.</td>', 'I think your chosen exception to the cloning rule was well deserved based on the outcome of the image.  Nice work; a truly exciting view...very appropriate for the subject matter.', '2005-02-16 16:24:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(1175225, 144009, 20779, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by digital1:</b></div><hr/><i> I think your chosen exception to the cloning rule was well deserved based on the outcome of the image.  Nice work; a truly exciting view...very appropriate for the subject matter. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thank you! I hardly do any editing because I am so weak at it, and I think I am just obstinate that way! I cloned out the part of the floor showing that bothered some, but didn''t like it that "clean" and put it back in! lol</td>', 'Originally posted by digital1: I think your chosen exception to the cloning rule was well deserved based on the outcome of the image.  Nice work; a truly exciting view...very appropriate for the subject matter.   Thank you! I hardly do any editing because I am so weak at it, and I think I am just obstinate that way! I cloned out the part of the floor showing that bothered some, but didn''t like it that "clean" and put it back in! lol', '2005-02-16 16:32:31.000000', NULL, 0),
