(1181130, 143954, 30364, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by grawk:</b></div><hr/><i> makes me think of cuba. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Ha!  You''re nearly right.  It''s New Zealand, &amp; we''re headed down the same path as Cuba, except our Prime Minister''s beard isn''t as impressive (yet).  But she''s working on it.</td>', 'Originally posted by grawk: makes me think of cuba.   Ha!  You''re nearly right.  It''s New Zealand, & we''re headed down the same path as Cuba, except our Prime Minister''s beard isn''t as impressive (yet).  But she''s working on it.', '2005-02-18 21:09:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(1181522, 143716, 23478, '<td valign="top">Well, I thought the unique angle with the contrast of the pink and green would make this a good shot.  Then I saw all the other flower shot in the "Pink" challenge!  Overall, I was pleased with my shot, but after seeing all the other entries, I realized I should have been more creative... thanks for the two comments I recieved:)</td>', 'Well, I thought the unique angle with the contrast of the pink and green would make this a good shot.  Then I saw all the other flower shot in the "Pink" challenge!  Overall, I was pleased with my shot, but after seeing all the other entries, I realized I should have been more creative... thanks for the two comments I recieved:)', '2005-02-19 03:18:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(1181778, 144204, 33701, '<td valign="top">a pink rose for you.</td>', 'a pink rose for you.', '2005-02-19 09:57:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(1182188, 144407, 30918, '<td valign="top">I like the shot!!But the flash have "overreflected" on the nose, shoulders.. Maybe a filter would have been better.Just an idea, i don''t think i would have do better than you!Congrats.</td>', 'I like the shot!!But the flash have "overreflected" on the nose, shoulders.. Maybe a filter would have been better.Just an idea, i don''t think i would have do better than you!Congrats.', '2005-02-19 14:25:57.000000', NULL, 0),
