(1315568, 143905, 34659, '<td valign="top">Because you liked my "Abandoned Buildings" entry so much, I looked up your profile and saw this photo.  Absolutely exquisite!  I really like it.  I''ve only been in the group for a few months, but am starting to enjoy it very much.  It''s challenging on a daily basis and keeps me wanting more and more from myself.<br/> <br/>Just thought I''d share that I loved your "Shall we dance?" photo (of course, your other shots are very nice too).<br/> <br/>Thanks again for the encouragement and I wish you luck on our next outing!  :-)<br/> <br/>Jimmy Carter<br/>CRC Services<br/>SJCarter Photography<br/>PO Box 576<br/>Buchanan, VA 24066<br/>crcservices@msn.com<br/></td>', 'Because you liked my "Abandoned Buildings" entry so much, I looked up your profile and saw this photo.  Absolutely exquisite!  I really like it.  I''ve only been in the group for a few months, but am starting to enjoy it very much.  It''s challenging on a daily basis and keeps me wanting more and more from myself. Just thought I''d share that I loved your "Shall we dance?" photo (of course, your other shots are very nice too). Thanks again for the encouragement and I wish you luck on our next outing!  :-) Jimmy CarterCRC ServicesSJCarter PhotographyPO Box 576Buchanan, VA 24066crcservices@msn.com', '2005-04-23 15:32:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(1320221, 143515, 18450, '<td valign="top">Composition and perspective of this shot is outstanding!! I think it was underrated in the Pink Challenge.</td>', 'Composition and perspective of this shot is outstanding!! I think it was underrated in the Pink Challenge.', '2005-04-24 20:11:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(1355572, 144452, 6388, '<td valign="top">very cool.  As ridiculously cool as the painting is, it''s the interaction between it and the artist that makes this great.  I love the way she''s she''s communicating with the heart. Her gaze is reciprocated by the painting as it runs out onto her feet.   After going through the rest of the entries, I''d easily have predicted this to be on the front page.<br/> <br/>P<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-05-04 04:28:56.</i></td>', 'very cool.  As ridiculously cool as the painting is, it''s the interaction between it and the artist that makes this great.  I love the way she''s she''s communicating with the heart. Her gaze is reciprocated by the painting as it runs out onto her feet.   After going through the rest of the entries, I''d easily have predicted this to be on the front page. P', '2005-05-03 13:23:30.000000', '2005-05-04 05:28:56.000000', 0),
